"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nGodot 4.6, master as of June 16, 2026\n\n### System information\n\nMacOS\n\n### Issue description\n\nApple binaries when properly packages to take advantage of various platform features are distributed as .framework or .xcframework packages (these for instance allow iOS applications to dynamically link during development, but statically link for release files).\n\nThose files contain symlinks, you can pick any packages from here: https://github.com/migueldeicaza/GodotApplePlugins/releases\n\nWhen those packages are unpacked by the user, they work out of the box, when they are unpacked by Godot they produce broken installations, rather than creating the symlink, these files that are intended to be dynamic libraries are replaced with the text of the symlink.\n\nOn Godot 4.6, this crashes the editor: https://gist.github.com/migueldeicaza/5b8b7b7ba245807bc43cfd4d5a210005\n\nOn Godot master, the addons fail to load:\nhttps://gist.github.com/migueldeicaza/8ec4c2ef06711ea4dba41d2f730fc2d4\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nInstall \"Godot Apple Plugins\" from the Asset Library/Asset Store.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n#### 4.6\n\n- Empty project\n- then download \"Godot Apple Plugins\" into your project from Asset Library\n- crash\n\n#### master/4.7\n\n- Empty project\n- download manually https://github.com/migueldeicaza/GodotApplePlugins/releases/download/build-3781b9c19eaf69b2387eacecf4b6f88fc8d07e65/GodotApplePlugins-addons-3781b9c19eaf69b2387eacecf4b6f88fc8d07e65.zip\n- Select Asset Store\n- Select \"Import\"\n- Pick the file from the path, and check the box \"Ignore asset root\"\n\nConsole will display all the errors, you can check then \"addons\" and you will see that the symlinks are gone, and instead contain plain files with the name of the actual file to 